#: settings.py:553
msgid ""
"Empty: searched for (koreader in PATH, AppImage in ~/Applications or "
"~/Downloads, Flatpak). Only fill in if it is somewhere else. flatpak: "
"always the Flatpak rocks.koreader.KOReader, even if KOReader is also "
